# Cloudflare adds its Web Analytics script to any page it is allowed to change, and
# no-transform on Cache-Control tells it not to. That keeps zakir.id free of Cloudflare's
# analytics whatever the dashboard says. Everything else in the value is the default for
# pages, to always check for a newer one.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-transform
